    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the heads up. i'm just kind of worried about the cost of a doctor visit right now since my insurance is acting up. is it possible it's just localized inflammation from the metal? i could just take some ibuprofen and keep the ointment on it for another day to see if the redness goes away? it doesn't really hurt, it just looks weird.",
